      "trackName": "AirPolygon WT",
      "description": "The popular 3D puzzle game has finally arrived on apple watch!\nThe gameplay is very simple: use your finger to swipe the screen and control the rotation of the pieces. When you rotate them to a certain angle, you'll discover what the object actually is. Of course, the game has a time limit. If you quickly piece together the pattern, you'll earn corresponding star rewards. If the time runs out before you complete it, don’t worry—there will be navigational hints to help you pass the level. Keep challenging yourself, and you'll definitely be able to earn all the stars.\n\nWe will continuously add new shapes, so stay tuned.\n\nThis game also has an AR version. If you're interested, please visit our website for more information.",
